            "created_at": "2025-08-25T18:30:43.720549+00:00",
            "notes": "[Sacred Shuriken](item_b32b34a9-0163-4092-875e-3a9817b7df54) for more poke, great if theres easy to shoot tanks.\n\n[Hashimoto\u2019s Bane](item_03650ff3-917e-45fe-aeed-11c0f24c0eba) is good if there squishy targets that die fast like Ashe or Zen, where you have to be more like an assassin.\n\n[Forged Under Fire](item_b60b1aa3-e69d-4d19-b3d8-43de1cce110c) and [Spirit of Sojiro](item_273ac0b7-f669-4641-bd77-2826aadd3218) help with sustain if you die too fast.\n\nYou can sell either [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) or  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054), depending on what you feel like is best for the game.\n\nIf poor [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27).\n\nJust selling either [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is good too.",
